msgid "Classic CAN 的平台机制与接入边界"
msgstr "Classic CAN mechanisms and integration boundaries"

msgid ""
"当前公共接口是 `nexus/io/can.h`，生产实现归属 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`， 精确适配 "
"STM32F407VET6／ZGT6 的 classic CAN。家族目录不表示所有 STM32F4 器件已完成适配。Native 位于 "
"`tests/support/native/`，仅保留为显式启用的 主机测试模型。当前硬件模式为 CAN 2.0A/B：11/29-bit "
"ID、DATA/RTR、0–8-byte DLC；接口拒绝 CAN FD、大于 8 的发送 DLC 和越界 ID。"
msgstr ""
"The public interface is `nexus/io/can.h`. The production implementation "
"belongs to `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`, with exact classic CAN integration for "
"STM32F407VET6/ZGT6. A family directory does not mean every STM32F4 device is"
" integrated. Native lives under `tests/support/native/` solely as an "
"explicitly enabled host model. The hardware mode is CAN 2.0A/B: 11/29-bit "
"IDs, DATA/RTR and 0–8-byte DLC. The interface rejects CAN FD, TX DLC above 8"
" and out-of-range IDs."

msgid "静态对象与执行"
msgstr "Static objects and execution"

msgid ""
"公共 `nx_can_port_t` 只含 readonly ops 与私有 context。三个真实硬件邮箱对应 三个静态 slot，没有软件 TX "
"队列、分配器、全局可变 registry、worker 或必选 OS。 接收事件环由装配提供精确容量。未选实例不生成状态；当前生产单元的 ARM "
"objects 没有 `.data`/`.bss`，最终未选 ELF 的 GC/资源验证由实际装配构建建立。"
msgstr ""
"Public `nx_can_port_t` contains only read-only ops and private context. "
"Three physical mailboxes correspond to three static slots, without software "
"TX queues, allocators, global mutable registries, workers or mandatory OS. "
"Assembly supplies the exact receive-ring capacity. Unselected instances "
"generate no state. Current production ARM objects have no `.data`/`.bss`; "
"actual assembly builds establish final unselected-ELF GC/resource results."

msgid ""
"一个特权任务执行者序列化 submit、cancel、service、read、recover 和 stop；入口 拒绝 Handler、非特权或已有 "
"PRIMASK/BASEPRI/FAULTMASK 屏蔽状态。四条 IRQ 执行 有界邮箱/接收处理：最多三个邮箱、两个 FIFO 各三个初始帧。MCU"
" 的寄存器访问 是 direct volatile MMIO；Native 只在模型编译时替换外部寄存器/NVIC 叶端口， 生产 MCU "
"不携带模型访问表或运行时模型分支。"
msgstr ""
"One privileged task executor serializes submit, cancel, service, read, "
"recover and stop. Entries reject Handler, unprivileged or already masked "
"PRIMASK/BASEPRI/FAULTMASK contexts. Four IRQs perform bounded "
"mailbox/receive work: at most three mailboxes and three initially present "
"frames from each of two FIFOs. MCU registers use direct volatile MMIO; "
"Native replaces only external register/NVIC leaves in model builds. "
"Production MCUs carry no model-access tables or runtime-model branches."

msgid ""
"IRQ wake 是提示，不替代 request predicate。绑定时读取四条实际 IRQ priority 和 grouping，逐条验证 "
"policy/syscall ceiling；不修改全局 grouping。sink 必须 同时支持任务 service/cancel 与 IRQ "
"通知。捕获 sink 后执行者计数继续保留借用； stop、detach 或 recover 在通知尚未返回时报告 BUSY。"
msgstr ""
"IRQ wake is a hint, never a request-predicate substitute. Binding reads all "
"four actual IRQ priorities/grouping and validates each policy/syscall "
"ceiling without changing global grouping. Sinks support task service/cancel "
"and IRQ notifications. Executor counts retain the borrow after sink capture;"
" stop, detach or recover returns BUSY while notifications have not returned."

msgid "共享过滤器域与硬件事实"
msgstr "Shared filter domains and hardware facts"

msgid ""
"每个装配显式生成一个 `nx_can_filter_domain_t`，拥有主时钟、次时钟、28 个共享 filter banks、split 与 "
"immutable filter plan。无其他 controller 持有 active bit 时才允许 domain stop "
"释放时钟。STM32 CAN2 依赖 CAN1 的时钟/过滤器域。 停止一个实例不 reset 主 controller，也不覆盖 peer "
"filters。"
msgstr ""
"Each assembly explicitly generates an `nx_can_filter_domain_t` owning the "
"primary and secondary clocks, 28 shared filter banks, split and immutable "
"filter plan. Domain stop may release clocks only when no other controller "
"retains an active bit. STM32 CAN2 depends on the CAN1 clock/filter domain. "
"Stopping one instance neither resets the primary controller nor overwrites "
"peer filters."

msgid "SoC"
msgstr "SoC"

msgid "控制器"
msgstr "Controllers"

msgid "CAN 输入时钟"
msgstr "CAN input clock"

msgid "TX/RX0/RX1/error IRQ"
msgstr "TX/RX0/RX1/error IRQ"

msgid "STM32F407"
msgstr "STM32F407"

msgid "CAN1 / CAN2"
msgstr "CAN1 / CAN2"

msgid "APB1 42 MHz"
msgstr "APB1 42 MHz"

msgid "19/20/21/22；63/64/65/66"
msgstr "19/20/21/22；63/64/65/66"

msgid ""
"私有绑定用锁定 SDK 的真实寄存器 offset、bit masks、mailbox/FIFO/filter stride、 CPU IRQ 数和 "
"NVIC priority bits 做编译期/启动期检查。CAN 输入没有 APB timer 的 "
"倍频规则。prescaler/BS1/BS2/SJW 使用物理计数，必须精确满足 `clock_hz = bitrate × prescaler × "
"(1 + BS1 + BS2)`；不搜索或替换参数。 第一版采用单次发送 NART，关闭 ABOM，RX 使用 locked FIFO；过滤器只实现 "
"32-bit mask，显式匹配 IDE，可选择匹配 RTR。过滤器归属与 bank/split 范围先验证再写。"
msgstr ""
"Private bindings check actual register offsets, bit masks, "
"mailbox/FIFO/filter strides, CPU IRQ counts and NVIC priority bits against "
"locked SDKs at compile/startup time. CAN input has no APB-timer doubling "
"rule. Prescaler/BS1/BS2/SJW are physical counts and must exactly satisfy "
"`clock_hz = bitrate × prescaler × (1 + BS1 + BS2)`; parameters are not "
"searched or substituted. Initial support uses one-shot NART, ABOM off and "
"locked RX FIFOs. Filters provide only 32-bit masks, explicitly match IDE and"
" optionally RTR. Filter ownership and bank/split ranges are validated before"
" writes."

msgid ""
"安全装配顺序是：reviewed Board electrical/pin handoff → domain initialize → 各 "
"controller initialize → 外部执行者启动。cold initialize 在 acknowledged init 中证明没有未知 "
"TXRQ，并 drain retained RX FIFO；IER、四条 IRQ 使能与 priority 读回不符会保留 "
"closing/retained 责任。退出顺序是各 controller stop 成功 → domain stop 成功 → Board "
"pin/electrical lease release。失败时不得回收 provider、ring、filter plan 或 sink。"
msgstr ""
"Safe assembly order is reviewed Board electrical/pin handoff → domain "
"initialize → each controller initialize → external executor start. Cold "
"initialization proves no unknown TXRQ in acknowledged init and drains "
"retained RX FIFO. Failed IER, four-IRQ-enable or priority readbacks retain "
"closing responsibility. Exit is each controller stop succeeds → domain stop "
"succeeds → Board pin/electrical lease release. Failure prohibits reclaiming "
"provider, ring, filter plan or sink."

msgid "完成、取消与恢复"
msgstr "Completion, cancellation and recovery"

msgid ""
"prepare 在 READY/已消费 SETTLED storage 中复制 value frame；ACCEPTED 后借用整个 request 到"
" acquire-observed SETTLED。第四个请求、非法 frame/context/deadline、 以及 request 与 "
"controller/ring/domain/filter plan 的重叠都拒绝且不产生借用。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare copies value frames into READY/consumed SETTLED storage. ACCEPTED "
"borrows the full request until acquire-observed SETTLED. A fourth request, "
"invalid frame/context/deadline or overlap with controller/ring/domain/filter"
" plan is rejected without borrows."

msgid ""
"线上完成必须同时观察 RQCP、TME 和 TXRQ clear；只有 TXOK 能证明发送成功。 清 W1C completion 后还要读回 "
"RQCP clear，随后解除 slot，最后 release-publish SETTLED；这之后 provider 不再访问 "
"request。cancel/timeout/bus-off/stop 请求 abort 并等待真实 acknowledgement；deadline "
"不能撤销借用。drain 超时或 W1C 清除失败保留 QUARANTINED。TXOK 与 cancel 竞争时保留真实 SUCCESS，不保证帧 "
"从未上线。RTR 成功的 transferred 为零，DATA 为 DLC。"
msgstr ""
"Wire completion requires RQCP, TME and cleared TXRQ together; only TXOK "
"proves successful transmission. After W1C completion clearing, RQCP clear is"
" read back before slot detachment and final release-publication of SETTLED; "
"the provider never accesses requests afterward. Cancel/timeout/bus-off/stop "
"requests abort and waits for actual acknowledgement; deadlines do not revoke"
" borrows. Drain timeout or failed W1C clearing retains QUARANTINED. TXOK "
"racing cancel retains actual SUCCESS and cannot guarantee the frame never "
"reached the wire. Successful RTR transferred count is zero; DATA count is "
"DLC."

msgid "bus-off/TEC/REC/last-error 的 authoritative snapshot 不依赖 RX ring 是否有空位。 公共 `last_error` 是单字节 `nx_can_protocol_error_t`：NONE、ACK、STUFF、FORM、 BIT_DOMINANT、BIT_RECESSIVE、CRC 或 UNKNOWN；provider 转换硅片编码，应用不解释 LEC 位。BIT 名称表示发送者期望的电平，分类不标识某个 frame，也不证明当前总线状态。 ABOM 关闭；recover 是显式 controller-local init，在所有 TX loan 与 publisher 退出后执行，不重发原帧，不 reset 活跃 peer。未完成硬件/IRQ/FIFO drain 的 stop 返回 BUSY，保留原 storage。成功 stop 后 read_events 拒绝 STATE，不接触已释放 接收环。"
msgstr "Authoritative bus-off/TEC/REC/last-error snapshots are independent of RX-ring space. Public `last_error` uses the one-byte `nx_can_protocol_error_t`: NONE, ACK, STUFF, FORM, BIT_DOMINANT, BIT_RECESSIVE, CRC or UNKNOWN. The provider translates silicon encodings; applications do not interpret LEC bits. BIT names identify the level intended by the transmitter. A category identifies neither an affected frame nor a current bus condition. ABOM is disabled; recover is explicit controller-local init after all TX loans and publishers exit, never replaying original frames or resetting active peers. Stop with incomplete hardware/IRQ/FIFO drain returns BUSY and retains original storage. After successful stop, read_events rejects STATE without touching released rings."

msgid "接收与丢失事实"
msgstr "Receive and loss facts"

msgid "接收保存 value frame、逻辑 `filter_tag`、raw DLC 与 IRQ acquisition timestamp。 raw DLC 9–15 被规范为 8 并加标志，最多复制八字节；不解释为 CAN FD。时间不是 物理 SOF timestamp。RFOM 必须读回释放完成后才能发布一次事件；卡住时停止 admission 并保留责任，不能重复发布同一个硬件邮箱。"
msgstr "Received records retain the value frame, logical `filter_tag`, raw DLC and IRQ-acquisition timestamp. Raw DLC 9–15 is normalized to eight with a flag and at most eight copied bytes; it is not CAN FD. The timestamp is not physical SOF. RFOM release must be read back before publishing one event. A stuck release closes admission and retains responsibility rather than publishing the same hardware mailbox twice."

msgid "每条 filter 可显式设置 1–65535 的 `tag`，同一 controller 内不得重复；省略时按该 controller 的 filter 声明顺序从 1 编号，与物理 bank 无关。需要跨配置调整保持规则身份 时应显式填写。无法识别的硬件 match 保留 frame，返回 `filter_tag=0` 和 `NX_CAN_FILTER_UNKNOWN`，不猜测匹配规则。应用按 tag 执行策略前须检查该标志。"
msgstr "Each filter may specify a `tag` from 1 through 65535, unique within its controller. When omitted, tags follow that controller's filter declaration order starting at one, independently of physical banks. Explicit tags should be supplied when rule identity must survive configuration changes. An unrecognized hardware match retains the frame and reports `filter_tag=0` with `NX_CAN_FILTER_UNKNOWN`, without guessing a rule. Applications must check this flag before applying tag-based policy."

msgid "F4 私有配置按 RM0090 Rev22 第 1082 页 Figure343 计算 `match_index`：两个 FIFO 独立编号，未启用的 bank 也占位置；本实现选中 bank 为 32-bit mask，其余为未启用的 16-bit mask/FIFO0。生成器只输出不可变对应关系，C 冷态预检再次核验，RX 用同一 controller/FIFO 的已审对应关系转换 tag；没有新增运行期注册表或可变映射数组。 RX 查找为所选 filter 数量的有界线性工作，最多 28 条；每次 IRQ 至多处理六帧。"
msgstr "The private F4 configuration derives `match_index` from RM0090 Rev22 page 1082 Figure343: the two FIFOs have independent numbering and inactive banks still consume positions. This implementation selects 32-bit mask banks and leaves other banks as inactive 16-bit mask/FIFO0. The generator emits immutable mappings only. Cold C preflight verifies them again, and RX translates tags through the reviewed mapping for the same controller and FIFO. No runtime registry or mutable mapping array is added. RX lookup is bounded linear work over at most 28 selected filters, with at most six frames processed per IRQ."

msgid ""
"事件环不覆盖未消费事实。软件丢失计数是精确值；硬件 FIFO overrun 只报告下界。 locked FIFO 中先前保存的帧先于 overrun "
"loss marker；pending loss 排在旧 buffered 事件后、未来新帧前。饱和计数有显式标记。错误状态单独锁存，不借事件队列容量 "
"决定 completion 或 bus-off 是否存在。"
msgstr ""
"The event ring never overwrites unconsumed facts. Software loss counts are "
"exact; hardware FIFO overrun reports a lower bound only. Frames previously "
"retained in locked FIFO precede overrun loss markers; pending loss follows "
"old buffered events and precedes future frames. Saturation is explicitly "
"marked. Error state is separately latched; event-queue capacity never "
"decides whether completion or bus-off exists."

msgid "Board 来源与软件/物理资格"
msgstr "Board provenance and software/physical qualification"

msgid ""
"启明 V3.1 原始 tree `08c5f513f1677388fcacaa519dca0c9ef00b6d2e` 的 CAN1 示例 blob "
"`8731616cf0d5bf02917c76463c49e722b39eb415` 给出 PA11 RX/PA12 TX AF9； CAN2 blob"
" `ef8da679c5e7c7163fe2a48a80b6ce8f9d6ecfaa` 给出 PB12 RX/PB13 TX AF9。 "
"[用户手册](https://github.com/petercwq/STM32407/blob/08c5f513f1677388fcacaa519dca0c9ef00b6d2e/启明欣欣407开发板(高配版)V3.1例程使用手册.pdf)"
" printed18/physical20 给出 TJA1050 U9/U11、5 V supply、RS 接地、120 Ω R35/R49。 "
"P21/P15 是人工复用跳帽；不能虚构软件 standby GPIO，也不能把软件 pin claim 当作实物跳帽证明。CAN1 与 USART1 "
"RTS/CTS、USB FS 的 PA11/PA12 必须拒绝并选。 天空星当前没有审阅的外接 CAN transceiver 路线，不猜 Board "
"binding。"
msgstr ""
"The Qiming V3.1 original tree `08c5f513f1677388fcacaa519dca0c9ef00b6d2e` "
"provides PA11 RX/PA12 TX AF9 in CAN1 example blob "
"`8731616cf0d5bf02917c76463c49e722b39eb415`, and PB12 RX/PB13 TX AF9 in CAN2 "
"blob `ef8da679c5e7c7163fe2a48a80b6ce8f9d6ecfaa`. The [user "
"manual](https://github.com/petercwq/STM32407/blob/08c5f513f1677388fcacaa519dca0c9ef00b6d2e/启明欣欣407开发板(高配版)V3.1例程使用手册.pdf),"
" printed18/physical20, specifies TJA1050 U9/U11, a 5 V supply, grounded RS "
"and 120 Ω R35/R49. P21/P15 are manually selected multiplexing jumpers; do "
"not invent a software standby GPIO or treat a software pin claim as proof of"
" physical jumper placement. CAN1 must be rejected when selected together "
"with USART1 RTS/CTS or USB FS on PA11/PA12. Sky Star currently has no "
"reviewed external CAN transceiver route; do not guess a Board binding."

msgid ""
"F4 绑定位于 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/can.c`，控制器机制位于 "
"`soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/classic_can/`；真实硬件定义来自锁定的 "
"`vendors/st/cmsis_device_f4/`。Native 叶端口位于 "
"`tests/support/native/drivers/can*`。当前 GoogleTest/GoogleMock、配置／factory／ "
"向量集成与精确 ARM ELF 分别验证其合同，不由一个旧开发 harness 代替。"
msgstr ""
"The F4 binding is `soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/can.c`, and the controller "
"mechanism is `soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/classic_can/`. Real hardware "
"definitions come from locked `vendors/st/cmsis_device_f4/`. Native leaf "
"ports are under `tests/support/native/drivers/can*`. Current "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock, configuration/factory/vector integration and exact "
"ARM ELF checks verify their respective contracts; an old development harness"
" does not substitute for them."

msgid ""
"[原始跨系列开发证据（历史）](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/83a27dfbee4e8fbf4d35875b1e9db85af7516eec/tools/testing/evidence/can-"
"iteration/manifest.json) 保留当时的固定源码哈希、工具身份、RED／GREEN 与执行范围，原始字节不修改。 "
"其中已退役系列和旧接口的计数不属于当前 F4 候选验收；当前用例数、资源与完整 门禁结论必须绑定本次提交，不能继承历史通过状态。"
msgstr ""
"[Original cross-family development evidence "
"(historical)](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/83a27dfbee4e8fbf4d35875b1e9db85af7516eec/tools/testing/evidence/can-"
"iteration/manifest.json) retains its original source hashes, tool "
"identities, RED/GREEN and execution scope without byte changes. Counts for "
"retired series and old interfaces do not enter current F4 candidate "
"acceptance. Current case counts, resources and complete-gate conclusions "
"must bind this commit rather than inherit historical passes."

msgid ""
"物理 CAN 波形、晶振/传播/采样点容差、termination、跳帽/电压、transceiver、 仲裁/ACK/error 注入、bus-off"
" 恢复时间与最大 IRQ 屏蔽/WCET 均未执行 HIL。 有限 poll_limit 是软件工作预算，不证明实物 init "
"最长应答时间；寄存器模型也不 证明总线故障或 store corruption。外部 CANopen/产品重试/总线管理策略归产品工程。"
msgstr ""
"Physical CAN waveforms, oscillator/propagation/sample-point tolerance, "
"termination, jumpers/voltage, transceivers, arbitration/ACK/error injection,"
" bus-off recovery time and maximum IRQ-masked/WCET timing have no executed "
"HIL. Finite poll_limit is a software-work budget, not proof of longest "
"physical init response; register models prove neither bus faults nor store "
"corruption. External CANopen, product retries and bus-management policy "
"belong to product projects."
